# Provider plugin cache — restored on `terraform init`, not source-controlled.
.terraform/
# Lockfile is NOT committed: each machine self-locks within the ~>
# constraints (no shared file = no cross-platform hash mismatch, zero
# maintenance). Tradeoff accepted — see /docs/terraform.html.
.terraform.lock.hcl
# Crash log from rare terraform crashes — never check in.
crash.log
